tica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\"><font color=\"#908858\"><b>Langer \nBriser</b></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Arbalest</span></font></p></center></td>\n<td width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">Two-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(40.5-45) To (85.6-114)</font> (63.05-79.5 Avg)<br>Required Level: \n32<br>Required Strength: 52<br>Required Dexterity: 61<br>Base Weapon Speed: \n[-10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+170-200% Enhanced Damage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+10-30 To Maximum Damage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">33% \nChance Of Open Wounds</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 1-212 Lightning \nDamage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+30 To Life</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Knockback</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30-60% Better Chance Of \nGetting Magic Items</font>(varies)<br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font> </p></td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"Verdana,helvetica\"><span style=\"font-size:9pt;\">양손데미지 \n                            : <font color=\"#4850b8\">(40.5-45) To (85.6-114)</font> (63.05-79.5 Avg)<br>레벨 요구치 \n                            : \n32<br>힘 요구치 : 52<br>덱스 요구치 : 61<br>무기긱본속도 : \n[-10]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+170-200% 증가된데미지 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+10-30 최대데미지 증가 </font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">33% \n상처회복저지 </font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">1-212 라이트닝 데미지 추가</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+30 라이프 </font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">뒤로밀침</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30-60% 매직아이템 얻을 확률증가</font>(varies)<br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n\n</span></font> </p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" st